title Ride sharing backend
direction right

Rider App [icon: mobile, color: blue]
Driver App [icon: mobile, color: green]

AWS [color: orange] {
  Edge {
    API Gateway [icon: aws-api-gateway]
    Realtime [icon: aws-api-gateway, label: WebSocket API]
  }
  Services [icon: aws-eks, color: teal] {
    Trips [icon: service]
    Matching [icon: service]
    Pricing [icon: service]
    Location [icon: service]
    Notifications [icon: aws-sns]
  }
  Data [color: purple] {
    Trips DB [icon: aws-aurora]
    Driver Positions [icon: aws-elasticache]
    Events [icon: aws-kinesis]
  }
}

Payments [icon: stripe]

Rider App > API Gateway: HTTPS
Driver App > Realtime: GPS every 4s
API Gateway > Trips: request ride
Trips > Pricing: quote
Trips > Matching: find driver
Realtime > Location
Location > Driver Positions: GEOADD
Matching > Driver Positions: nearby drivers
Matching --> Realtime: offer to driver
Trips > Trips DB
Trips --> Events: trip.completed
Trips > Payments: charge
Trips --> Notifications: driver arriving
Notifications --> Rider App: push
